	"data": "Reflection: \"Confidence\" (2019)\n\nThe Origin of Sovereignty\n\nI pulled this journal at random. It's a 7-minute audio transcript from 2019, transcribed March 2026. Chris is talking to Katie — \"you\" throughout is her. But the journal isn't really about Katie. It's about the long arc of becoming someone who could meet her.\n\nThe arc: school trauma around grades → low self-esteem → carrying that into relationships as need for external validation → marijuana at DePaul breaking the rigid self-image →…",
